  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Iron Eagle blessed land He Ruo recognizes him charging into the iron crown eagle group clad in wind and lightning. Narration places him as a Nu Er tribe Gu Immortal of Huang Jin bloodline, a famous rank seven expert on the same level as Unfettered Scholar and Pi Shui Han among demonic path comparisons, and as a sound path cultivator with Guan Chou as a transformation path peer from Guan tribe.",
      "chapters": [
        1107
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_iron_eagle_blessed_land",
        "char_he_ruo",
        "fac_nu_er_tribe",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline",
        "char_unfettered_scholar",
        "char_pi_shui_han",
        "char_guan_chou",
        "fac_guan_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has a small head and big belly, a disproportional body, popping eyeballs, limbs dry as twigs, and pale skin like a sick person without pinkness in the face. Looks deceive: he is a famous rank seven expert. When he uses his signature immortal killer move his body inflates to six times the original, looking like a highly pregnant woman, then he pats his belly to release booming sound waves that disorder the eagle group.",
      "chapters": [
        1107
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He later controls Nu Er tribe’s Immortal Gu House Loud Thunder Hall in a blood battle competition, laughing at its power, again described with the same small head, big belly, and pale sickly look. His great-aunt Nu Er Qian restrains him; by bloodline seniority she is his great-aunt despite a little-girl appearance, and he bows when she threatens him over thunder sound. Nu Er tribe sends Nu Er Qian and Nu Er Gu as main forces, with his nature called erratic and aggressive.",
      "chapters": [
        1193
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-battle-competition-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_loud_thunder_hall",
        "char_nu_er_qian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chu Du lists him with Nu Er Qian among experts to watch in the blood battle martial competition.",
      "chapters": [
        1202
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-among-experts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chu_du"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Liu Guan Yi’s crafty showing, Nu Er Gu warns Golden Dawn Hall that Liu Guan Yi is extremely crafty.",
      "chapters": [
        1205
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-among-experts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_golden_dawn_hall"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later ranks him with Ye Lui Qun Xing and Unfettered Scholar among rank seven characters he is wary of.",
      "chapters": [
        1206
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
